			"description": "Linked tile for one classroom: name, state badge, last update.",
			"html": "<a class=\"ds-aula\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-top\"><strong class=\"ds-name\">Aula 12</strong><span class=\"ds-go\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-sucio\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"/><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"/></svg>Sucio</span><small class=\"ds-updated\">Updated 21 Oct, 08:40</small></a>",
			"css": ".ds-aula{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:8px;justify-items:start;align-content:start;min-height:110px;width:220px;padding:12px;background:var(--color-surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--color-sucio-border,#fecdca);border-radius:var(--radius-md,10px);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(16 24 40/6%);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color 150ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),box-shadow 150ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-aula:hover{border-color:var(--color-border-strong,#c9ccd1);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgb(16 24 40/8%),0 1px 3px rgb(16 24 40/6%);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-aula:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-focus,#bc0613);outline-offset:2px}.ds-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;width:100%}.ds-name{font-family:'Work Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;color:var(--color-heading,#292929)}.ds-go{color:var(--color-text-subtle,#69727d)}.ds-aula:hover .ds-go{color:var(--color-link,#bc0613)}.ds-updated{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted,#5c646e)}.ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}.ds-sucio{background:var(--color-sucio-bg,#fef3f2);border-color:var(--color-sucio-border,#fecdca);color:var(--color-sucio-fg,#912018)}"
		},
		{
			"name": "App Header",
			"kind": "nav",
			"refersTo": "app-header",
			"description": "Seal-red band with the ESPOCH wordmark and a 3px bronze rule.",
			"html": "<header class=\"ds-header\"><a class=\"ds-wordmark\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-mark\">ESPOCH</span><span class=\"ds-sub\">Aulas limpias</span></a></header>",
			"css": ".ds-header{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:60px;padding:0 16px;background:var(--color-header,#bc0613);color:#fff;border-bottom:3px solid var(--color-accent,#b5a880)}.ds-wordmark{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.ds-mark{font-family:'Work Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.375rem;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1}.ds-sub{padding-left:8px;border-left:1px solid rgb(255 255 255/82%);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:rgb(255 255 255/82%)}"
		}
	],
	"narrative": {
		"northStar": "The Official Ledger",
		"overview": "Aulas limpias is a register, not a dashboard. Each classroom is a line in an institutional ledger: its state is the first thing read, the time of the last entry sits beneath it, and the photo evidence is part of the record rather than an apology for a failed check. The ESPOCH red works as a seal on the header band and the one primary action; everything between is ink on near-white, separated by hairlines instead of shadows or fills.",
		"keyCharacteristics": [
			"Restrained color: ink, hairlines and one institutional red, with state colors reserved for state.",
			"State is never color alone: every cleaning state pairs tint, icon and text.",
			"Mobile-first with a 44px touch floor, scaling to a stacked-to-table admin history.",
			"Flat at rest: hairline borders carry structure; shadow is feedback, not decoration.",
			"Fixed rem type scale and exact motion budget (150 to 200 ms), no choreography."
		],
		"rules": [
			{
				"name": "The Seal Rule",
				"body": "Brand red covers the header and the single primary action per view, roughly 10% of any screen at most. If red appears on a card, a heading or a divider, it is wrong.",
				"section": "colors"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Never Color Alone Rule",
				"body": "A cleaning state is always tint + icon + text. Removing the color must leave the state fully readable.",
				"section": "colors"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Subtle Floor Rule",
				"body": "Ink Subtle (#69727d) is the lightest text the system allows. Never go lighter \"for elegance\"; it already sits at 4.55:1.",
				"section": "colors"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Fixed Scale Rule",
				"body": "The scale is rem-based and fixed, a step ratio near 1.2. No clamp() headings.",
				"section": "typography"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Headings-Only Display Rule",
				"body": "Work Sans never sets a button, input, badge or table cell.",
				"section": "typography"
			},
			{
				"name": "The Hairline First Rule",
				"body": "Reach for a 1px hairline before a shadow. If a surface needs separating from its neighbor and a border does it, no shadow.",
				"section": "elevation"
			}
		],
		"dos": [
			"Do let the cleaning state be the first and heaviest thing on every screen: badge, icon and text together.",
			"Do keep the ESPOCH red to the header band and one primary action per view (The Seal Rule).",
			"Do use 44px as the minimum touch target and keep every text pair at 4.5:1 or better; Ink Subtle (#69727d) is the floor.",
			"Do separate surfaces with 1px hairlines first, shadow only as hover or overlay feedback.",
			"Do keep motion to 150 to 200 ms with cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) and honor prefers-reduced-motion.",
			"Do present the photo-evidence requirement as a natural step in the flow, with a clear label and hint, not as an error state. Ask for the photo only when the report is `sucio`; a `limpio` report stays a single tap.",
			"Do write labels as verb + object (\"Save report\", \"Create user\") in plain, direct, institutional language."
		],
		"donts": [
			"Don't build a generic SaaS dashboard: no identical cards with big numbers, no gradients, no neon accents.",
			"Don't drift into an outdated university portal: no dense default-typography tables, no flat colors from another era.",
			"Don't add playful consumer-app touches: no illustrations, no flashy animation, no casual tone.",
			"Don't signal a state with color alone; every state needs its icon and text.",
			"Don't use border-left or border-right wider than 1px as a colored stripe on cards, rows or alerts.",
			"Don't use gradient text, glassmorphism, or a hero-metric block (big number, small label, gradient accent).",
			"Don't set Work Sans on buttons, inputs, badges or table cells; it is for headings and classroom names.",
			"Don't nest cards, or open a modal where an inline or progressive pattern works.",
			"Don't animate layout properties or add page-load choreography; state change and feedback only."
		]
	}
}
